    "name": "VIRGO GLOW (Whipped Tallow - skin care) 9 oz glass jar",
    "description": "<p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ingredients : Pasture raised, grass-fed,&nbsp; grass finished beef tallow, Organic Unrefined cold Pressed Virgin coconut oil, Organic 100% Pure Cold Pressed, Hexane free, Extra Virgin Castor oil, Organic Pure Vitamin E oil, Organic Jojoba oil, 100% pure Organic therapeutic grade essential oil, Lemongrass, Frankincense, Cedarwood . All products sourced from glass and are free of Chemicals,Parabens, &amp; Synthetic Fragrance</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Each jar is hand crafted in small batches and may have slight variations in texture or scent.</span></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">Nourish your body with our all natural Whipped Tallow.&nbsp; Deeply moisturizing and healing with Anti-aging, antibacterial, anti-fungal and&nbsp; antimicrobial properties. Our whipped formula will not only enhance&nbsp; your natural collagen production but will leave your skin smooth, hydrated and glowing</span></p>",
